+// Set or remove a password on any file (the traverse highlight or the
+// current file). Removal verifies the password by entry - the key is
+// never assumed cached (leaving a file forgets it) - so the file does
+// not need to be open.
+void WP_requestPasswordFor(int fileIndex)
+{
